Idea:
Factory sorting game where you use machines to prevent the situation getting
out of hand (ie, packages going where they're not supposed to). As of right now,
these packages will be fireworks. 

Brainstorm:
- Conveyer belts
X Robots (Animate using sine waves) -> might be out of scope
- Gunpowder randomly explodes, forcing you to change the pathways
- Operate on strict tiles, using an array to determine which tiles go in which
direction and which tiles are useable.
- Up to three difficulty levels, involving one path, two paths, and three paths,
with each path transporting a different kind of firework.

